The retained layout-engine.js is a consolidated source adaptation. build.mjs
applies the explicit x/y/z extension and bundles its d3-force-3d runtime.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES is regenerated from the actual bundled runtime packages.

Rebuild in an empty directory outside the checkout:
copy build-package.json and build-package-lock.json to package.json and
package-lock.json, run npm ci --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org there,
then run node <this-directory>/build.mjs <the-build-directory>.
No node_modules directory or local build cache is shipped in the package.
